                  [
                    "Doro~ One flower is enough. The bees can have the rest.",
                    "Doro! The sun has warmed the stones by the water."
                  ],
                  [
                    "Doro~ The jasmine is blooming. Even the breeze smells sweet.",
                    "Doro! Give the swing a little push."
                  ],
                  [
                    "Doro~ I can see the stars through the trellis.",
                    "Doro! One more swing before we go inside."
                  ]
